From: William Emerison Six <billsix@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 21:47:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1089/3799] soh: rename func_80AFB748 -> EnSi_ClearAcHit

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: clears the collider's AC_HIT flag and returns 0; called once per frame from the idle action.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Si/z_en_si.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Si/z_en_si.c | 7 ++++---
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Si/z_en_si.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Si/z_en_si.c
index b6a871ba5..768948b9b 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Si/z_en_si.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Si/z_en_si.c
@@ -15,7 +15,8 @@ void EnSi_Destroy(Actor* thisx, PlayState* play);
 void EnSi_Update(Actor* thisx, PlayState* play);
 void EnSi_Draw(Actor* thisx, PlayState* play);
 
-s32 func_80AFB748(EnSi* this, PlayState* play);
+// LLM generated name (HIGH), was func_80AFB748: clears the collider's AC_HIT flag and returns 0; called once per frame from the idle action.
+s32 EnSi_ClearAcHit(EnSi* this, PlayState* play);  // was func_80AFB748 [LLM:HIGH]
 void func_80AFB768(EnSi* this, PlayState* play);
 void func_80AFB89C(EnSi* this, PlayState* play);
 void func_80AFB950(EnSi* this, PlayState* play);
@@ -73,7 +74,7 @@ void EnSi_Destroy(Actor* thisx, PlayState* play) {
     Collider_DestroyCylinder(play, &this->collider);
 }
 
-s32 func_80AFB748(EnSi* this, PlayState* play) {
+s32 EnSi_ClearAcHit(EnSi* this, PlayState* play) {
     if (this->collider.base.acFlags & AC_HIT) {
         this->collider.base.acFlags &= ~AC_HIT;
     }
@@ -91,7 +92,7 @@ void func_80AFB768(EnSi* this, PlayState* play) {
         this->actor.shape.rot.y += 0x400;
 
         if (!Player_InCsMode(play)) {
-            func_80AFB748(this, play);
+            EnSi_ClearAcHit(this, play);  // was func_80AFB748 [LLM:HIGH]
 
             if (this->collider.base.ocFlags2 & OC2_HIT_PLAYER) {
                 this->collider.base.ocFlags2 &= ~OC2_HIT_PLAYER;
